OL,3,ATwelve killed and 300 injured in attack
OL,4,Aon airport in Saudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F309 injured in an attack on the
OL,8,Finternational airport in Riyadh, Saudi
OL,9,FArabia, local authorities say.
OL,11,FThe deaths included four Saudis, two
OL,12,Fpeople from Bangladesh and one person
OL,13,Feach from the US, Jordan, Palestine,
OL,14,FSyria, Sudan and Egypt, the Saudi civil
OL,15,Faviation authority confirmed.
OL,17,FOperations at King Khalid International
OL,18,FAirport have been suspended.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
